  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Technical Assistance for Budget and Financial Accountability - Cambodia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Budget and Financial Accountability Team provides support to the Cambodian Ministry of Economy and Finance (MEF) through a series of intensive intermittent engagements to assist with the implementation of improvements to their budget process and practices and increasing fiscal transparency.</narrative>
  </description>
